cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite the release using this metadata. All bundled experiment outputs are SYNTHETIC; analog-capture reports depend on user-provided WAV files and are not independently authenticated."
title: "Orbit–Wave–OES Lab: synthetic orbit, wave-payload, telemetry replay, and binaural capture analysis"
type: software
authors:
