repository-code: "https://github.com/sparkainlp-x/orbit-wave-oes-lab"
abstract: >-
  Local release candidate combining a synthetic normalized orbit/environment
  timeline, signed-amplitude sine payload encoding, fixed-threshold synthetic
  readout, optional official OES-Resilience replay, static SHA-256 evidence
  passport, and offline analysis of a user-provided stereo analog-capture WAV.
  No physical orbit, quantum device, NV-center, QKD, audio hardware, or mission
  performance is validated. Collaborators credited in the README are not creators.
keywords:
  - synthetic-data
  - orbit
  - wave-encoding
  - telemetry
  - anomaly-detection
  - binaural-audio
  - analog-calibration
  - reproducibility
